            "subheading": "<p>Saira Birthstone Charm</p>",
            "title": "<h2>Personal Intuition & Self-Discovery</h2>",
            "description": "<p>The Saira Birthstone Charm brings together the symbolism of your chosen birthstone with the enduring spirit of the Saira collection.</p><p>A deeply personal talisman, it represents intuition, individuality and the moments that define your journey. Whether chosen to honour yourself or someone you hold close, it serves as a meaningful reminder to trust your own path while celebrating the people and memories that continue to shape you.</p>",
